reaks off their engagement and sends her home in disgrace to a province in ruins. With no aid in sight, Romelia vows to raise an army, rebuild the ruined towns, and restore a struggling kingdom as new conflicts arise. The war may be over, but her story’s just begun."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"長きにわたり旅をし、魔王ゼルギスを討ち果たしたロメリアと婚約者のアンリ王子。 しかし、アンリ王子は無慈悲にもロメリアに告げる。「婚約を破棄する」と。勝利に酔いしれるアンリたちを横目に、ロメリアは次なる旅へと向かった。 戦乱を通じて荒廃した祖国と、魔族に奪われた人々の暮らし。 魔王を倒したからといって、目の前に積みあがった問題が片付くわけではない。だから、私は私のやり方で、人々の幸せな暮らしを取り戻してみせる。 軍を興し、経済を動かし、時に陰謀に巻き込まれながらも、彼女は歩みを止めない。しかしその選択は、ロメリアの前にさらなる戦禍を運んでくる。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hXWCx0n6cYBMcjngZ8M2iZXLwmZ.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hXWCx0n6cYBMcjngZ8M2iZXLwmZ.png","language":"en","width":1200,"height":166},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rXhM84r2mONUz5L4fpAnhTnCXf4.svg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rXhM84r2mONUz5L4fpAnhTnCXf4.svg","language":"ja","width":509,"height":135}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xOhx5KpSAlrEbqsu9TaCdmdIb72.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xOhx5KpSAlrEbqsu9TaCdmdIb72.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2wqyITVWs1wZMih2VraylRjqzCo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2wqyITVWs1wZMih2VraylRjqzCo.jpg","language":"ja","width":1376,"height":2064},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3OmxNPz5vt43qX6rShrmXndSZvc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3OmxNPz5vt43qX6rShrmXndSZvc.jpg","language":"ja","width":1500,"height":2120},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/powL7WbmmkHiygKaDHXgPDrVyuV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/powL7WbmmkHiygKaDHXgPDrVyuV.jpg","language":"ja","width":1452,"height":2048},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gyMINlLwZsxCnNmwCh1pG15cqj2.jpg","preview